    "Frame intervals include browser scheduling, GPU readback and vsync. GPU reports sum of shadow, opaque, transparency and compositing passes.",
    "CPU submit measures encoding, uniforms and submission, not GPU execution.",
    "Buffers are explicit scene buffer sizes, not total VRAM. All representations remain resident.",
